                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.A4e/625: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1926-07-26T17:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 26, 1926—5
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>148. Your 298, July 24, 3 p.m. [<hi rendition="#italic">a.m.</hi>], 301, July 24,
                    6 p.m. Department approves action taken by you, as stated therein.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
